>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Deficient numbers below 100; expect 76.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DEFICIENT-NUMBERS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT   PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-P       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-D       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-Q       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-R       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-PRIME   PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUM PIC 9(9).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P >= 100
        MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
        PERFORM VARYING WS-D FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-D >= WS-P
            DIVIDE WS-P BY WS-D GIVING WS-Q REMAINDER WS-R
            IF WS-R = 0 ADD WS-D TO WS-SUM END-IF
        END-PERFORM
        IF WS-SUM < WS-P ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT
    STOP RUN.
